msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Stop givin' me the run-around, man! You're in the wrong\r\n"
"here for owin' all this money! And now you're gonna pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Please, not my awamori! It's the only thing keeping my\r\n"
"family going!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Fine, then I'll just take the land you're sittin' on\r\n"
"instead. Bring out the deed, now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"What? But my ancestors established this distillery\r\n"
"generations ago! I can't just hand it over like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"(A deed, huh? Maybe this has something to do with that\r\n"
"resort development deal...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "What's going on here? You mentioned a land deed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Please help me! This guy's after my awamori!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"I don't know who you are or where you came from, but you'd\r\n"
"better stay outta our business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"If this has got something to do with the resort development,\r\n"
"then I'm afraid it's my business, too. I've taken somewhat\r\n"
"of an interest in that issue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Huh? I ain't talking about any resort! This chump owes me\r\n"
"a fat stack of cash!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"I was just tellin' him that if he can't pay up, then he can\r\n"
"make good on his debt by givin' me the deed to his land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "So that's what this is about..."
msgstr "Oh, ecco di cosa si tratta..."

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Ugh. This is going nowhere. I'll let you off the hook today.\r\n"
"Either pay up in full, or bring me that deed. Your choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Thank you so much. You saved me from that brute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Not really. It sounds like you're still gonna have to pay\r\n"
"off that debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Yes, of course. I did borrow all that money, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"But I didn't have a choice! If I hadn't taken out that loan,\r\n"
"the distillery would have gone belly up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "You run a distillery?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"That's right. It's a bar nearby where we make our own local\r\n"
"spirits. Awamori, if you've never heard of it. Oh, and my\r\n"
"name's Matsushima."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"Good meeting you, Kiryu-san. A few years back, I borrowed\r\n"
"20 mil to try and expand my business. Compete with the other\r\n"
"big distilleries in town, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "And I take it the investment didn't pay off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"Actually, it was a resounding success! But we age our\r\n"
"awamori for years to create the perfect flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Turns out, the deadline to pay back those loans came around\r\n"
"while this most recent batch is still aging."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "When was the deadline?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"It's actually not for another year still, but now they're\r\n"
"saying if I don't pay back the full 20 million in a week,\r\n"
"I'm gonna have to hand over the distillery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "That's absurd. Don't you have a contract?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"About that... I looked over the fine print, and it did say\r\n"
"the lender has the right to demand repayment before the\r\n"
"deadline."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"That's how they get you. Still, only a week? They must\r\n"
"really be in a hurry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "If only I had another year... I could pay it back for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's when the awamori will be ready for market. I'll\r\n"
"be able to pay off my debt, no questions asked!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"I tried to explain that to the loan shark, but he kept\r\n"
"insisting I pay them right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Maybe if I could find that <Color:7>heirloom<Color:Default> Grandpa told me "
"about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Hm? What's this about an heirloom?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Oh, just something my grandfather mentioned on his deathbed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"He said if I was ever in trouble, I could sell our extremely\r\n"
"valuable family heirloom for extra cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"But I don't have the slightest idea where it is. Or if it\r\n"
"even exists, for that matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"I've heard that story before. Most family heirlooms don't\r\n"
"end up being the windfalls people expect them to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Why don't you talk to that loan shark again, try to explain\r\n"
"your current situation? That might be better than putting\r\n"
"all your eggs in this heirloom basket."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"He already knows my situation! That's why he's demanding I\r\n"
"pay now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"He just wants to steal the distillery from me. And the stock\r\n"
"of awamori we have aging."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "That'll net him way more than just the 20 million I owe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid ""
"That must've been his goal from the beginning, then. Set up\r\n"
"the contract, then go back on it and take not just the\r\n"
"distillery, but the booze too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "Ugh... The family heirloom's my only hope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"Apparently it's buried somewhere on the beach near some\r\n"
"orphanage. Evening Pride, I think it's called? Something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Wait, you mean Morning Glory?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Oh yeah, that's the one! You know it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"Know it? I run the place. Never guessed there'd be buried\r\n"
"treasure nearby, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "What luck! Fate must have brought us together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"Please, would you consider helping me find this precious\r\n"
"heirloom? I'll make it worth your time, I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"Sorry, man, but that loan's your responsibility. You should\r\n"
"find a more reasonable way to pay them back, instead of\r\n"
"relying on some mystery heirloom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "I know, but... still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"I don't know what I'm going to do... At this rate, I'm\r\n"
"going to lose both the distillery and the land..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"Awamori's an essential part of Okinawan culture, so I won't\r\n"
"just stand by while you get threatened. Let's find that\r\n"
"heirloom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much! I can't believe you're really so\r\n"
"willing to help a stranger like me... You're too kind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid ""
"Thank me once we've found the thing. So, do you have any\r\n"
"other clues that could help us find this heirloom?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"I do, actually. Our family has a special song that tells\r\n"
"us where the heirloom is hidden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"\"<Color:7>The sound of crashing waves upon the sand so hot,<Color:Default>\r\n"
"<Color:7>A golden foam flows over the sacred turtle's spot.<Color:Default>\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "\"The sound of crashing waves\" must mean it's near the ocean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"Makes sense. That would be the beach in front of Morning\r\n"
"Glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Yeah. That's definitely the place my grandpa mentioned to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid ""
"The problem is the second line:\r\n"
"\"<Color:7>A golden foam flows over the sacred turtle's spot<Color:Default>.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"I think \"golden\" and \"turtle\" must be big hints, but I've\r\n"
" got no clue as to what it means..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"Me neither. For now, I guess let's take a look near Morning\r\n"
"Glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"Yes, let's do that! Would you mind waiting here a moment\r\n"
"before we head out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"I need to check on some of the awamori in the distillery,\r\n"
"to make sure it's all aging properly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"When you're in the middle of this situation? You sure are\r\n"
"passionate about your work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"I may not make the best business decisions, but I'm damn\r\n"
"good at making fine alcohol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid ""
"In that case, stay here and keep an eye on your stock. I'll\r\n"
"go look for the treasure on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid ""
"Thanks for being so understanding! If you find anything,\r\n"
"please just call my cell. My number's 555-292-6674. That's\r\n"
"555-AWA-MORI, if you couldn't tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "...Right. I'll let you know what I find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Let's save your distillery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Sorry, can't help you."
msgstr ""

